    "When you say \"maximize total revenue,\" do you mean (a) maximize total sales revenue only (sum of sell price × units sold, ignoring purchase cost), (b) maximize net profit (sales revenue minus purchase cost), or (c) maximize net cash flow including the value of any leftover inventory at the end of December?"
  ],
